WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:03.180
- [Mark] All right, Ahli.

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:04.013
- Yes?

00:00:04.013 --> 00:00:04.846
- [Mark] Ahli where'd you grow up?

00:00:04.846 --> 00:00:05.820
Where you from originally?

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:07.140
- [Ahli] Boyle Heights.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:07.973
- [Mark] East LA?

00:00:07.973 --> 00:00:08.806
- [Ahli] Yes.

00:00:08.806 --> 00:00:09.639
- [Mark] (indistinct).

00:00:09.639 --> 00:00:10.472
Tell me about your family.

00:00:10.472 --> 00:00:11.740
Had both your parents when you were a kid?

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:13.640
- Yeah, both my parents at home.

00:00:17.385 --> 00:00:19.615
It was kind of fucked
up, oh my bad, excuse me.

00:00:19.615 --> 00:00:20.448
- [Mark] It's okay.

00:00:20.448 --> 00:00:23.155
- It was messed up but yeah.

00:00:23.155 --> 00:00:25.065
- [Mark] How would you
describe your childhood?

00:00:25.065 --> 00:00:25.982
- Horrible.

00:00:27.202 --> 00:00:28.520
I would describe it as a childhood,

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:29.603
It was taken from me.

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:32.773
So my dad abused me.

00:00:34.185 --> 00:00:36.100
- [Mark] What kind of stuff went on?

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.550
- He would sexually
abuse me in the closet.

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:39.763
Made me eat dog food.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.033
He killed my cat.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.983
I couldn't have an
animal cause he would it.

00:00:45.963 --> 00:00:48.936
Cause I love animals
and he would my animals,

00:00:48.936 --> 00:00:51.876
my rabbits and any little
animal I would get,

00:00:51.876 --> 00:00:53.830
he would just kill it in front of me.

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:56.230
- [Mark] And the sexual
abuse went on for how long?

00:00:56.230 --> 00:00:57.608
- Till I was like 13.

00:00:57.608 --> 00:00:59.058
When I was 13 I got pregnant.

00:01:00.203 --> 00:01:01.036
- [Mark] With your father?

00:01:01.036 --> 00:01:01.869
- Yeah.

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:04.683
I had my son.

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:07.853
He's 27 now.

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:11.750
Yeah, I don't see him.

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:13.003
I didn't raise him.

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:16.470
He got raised with somebody else,

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:18.248
like with another family

00:01:18.248 --> 00:01:20.340
but I see him as an adult now

00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:22.883
but I don't really see him,
I don't really know him.

00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:28.900
My dad got really sick
and died and I was happy

00:01:30.070 --> 00:01:31.123
because I hated him.

00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:34.360
And my mom, she's still alive

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.360
but I don't even see her either

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:39.063
because she let it all happen.

00:01:42.052 --> 00:01:44.630
And after I had my son
I started doing drugs.

00:01:44.630 --> 00:01:46.913
And a lot of drugs, started smoking crack.

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:48.870
I started smoking

00:01:50.337 --> 00:01:51.790
PCP and drinking

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:53.333
and I was just out there.

00:01:55.557 --> 00:01:57.840
Every boyfriend I would
get, they were all abusive.

00:01:57.840 --> 00:01:59.730
I was like drawn to that

00:02:01.822 --> 00:02:05.651
and so as an adult now
I ended up down here

00:02:05.651 --> 00:02:09.130
cause I was married to man for 13 years.

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:10.620
I got married actually

00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:13.494
but he abused me through
the whole 13 years

00:02:13.494 --> 00:02:17.480
so I finally left him and
I left him 7 years ago

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:20.030
and I ended up living down here.

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:22.413
And I had a normal life,
what you call normal.

00:02:24.747 --> 00:02:27.410
But I lost my job and I had a boyfriend,

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:29.150
another boyfriend he went to prison

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:31.070
and I ended up out here by myself.

00:02:31.070 --> 00:02:32.930
We were here together
but he went to prison

00:02:32.930 --> 00:02:36.220
and left me out here, left
me out here with the wolves.

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:37.960
And I didn't know anybody out here.

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:40.079
I didn't know where the
store was at, you know?

00:02:40.079 --> 00:02:41.150
Was so scared to be outside

00:02:41.150 --> 00:02:43.990
and it's just like, I'm outside.

00:02:43.990 --> 00:02:46.620
It's real, it gets real out here you know?

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:49.610
But at the end of the
day I'm still surviving

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:52.840
and some people have it worst off

00:02:54.381 --> 00:02:58.162
but I don't know just I
don't wish that upon anybody.

00:02:58.162 --> 00:03:00.412
- [Mark] What do you
think helps you survive?

00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:04.393
- Being grateful.

00:03:06.144 --> 00:03:09.900
Like a grateful attitude
for still being here

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:12.690
cause I still have my mind.

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:15.320
I still have my mind
right I guess you know?

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:16.363
I'm kind of (indistinct) but.

00:03:17.215 --> 00:03:18.048
- [Mark] Are you still using?

00:03:18.048 --> 00:03:21.393
- Yes I still use, I
use crystal meth yeah.

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:25.270
And it's just me and my dog and I have cat

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:27.325
actually I have two cats now.

00:03:27.325 --> 00:03:29.638
It's just me and them nobody else.

00:03:29.638 --> 00:03:31.710
- [Mark] Do you have any other children?

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:33.110
- No I have three grandkids,

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:36.823
I haven't seen them but I know of them.

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:39.593
And I have two little sisters.

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:43.630
They're not little no more
but they were younger than me.

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:46.240
They didn't go through none of that stuff

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:48.480
my mom separated from my dad when I was 17

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:51.093
so they were lucky.

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:55.331
- [Mark] Do you feel
like you were ever loved?

00:03:55.331 --> 00:03:56.633
- No.

00:03:56.633 --> 00:03:57.466
No.

00:03:57.466 --> 00:03:58.360
- [Mark] Not by your family?

00:03:58.360 --> 00:03:59.428
Not by anyone else?

00:03:59.428 --> 00:04:00.676
- Hmm-hm.

00:04:00.676 --> 00:04:01.509
I don't know what that is.

00:04:01.509 --> 00:04:03.290
- [Mark] How about by yourself?

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:06.163
- Well I'm starting to
do that I guess you know?

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:09.720
My goal is to get out of the street.

00:04:12.234 --> 00:04:13.795
But I know my dog loves me.

00:04:13.795 --> 00:04:15.300
(both laughing)

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:17.540
that's genuine love right there.

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:19.285
- [Mark] It is yeah.

00:04:19.285 --> 00:04:20.435
- Yep, can't deny that.

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:23.880
- [Mark] How'd you end up on Skid Row?

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:27.100
- Cause I left my apartment
cause I didn't have my job.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:29.670
He lost his job, my
boyfriend at the moment

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:32.030
and we ended up, we said
let's just put a tent up

00:04:32.030 --> 00:04:34.480
this will be temporary
and it's been 3 years now.

00:04:36.307 --> 00:04:38.130
- [Mark] What'd you do for money now?

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:43.050
- Sometimes I have dates,
sometimes I just get blessed

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:44.820
or I recycle.

00:04:44.820 --> 00:04:47.563
I don't like people so I'd rather recycle.

00:04:49.657 --> 00:04:52.808
But sometimes it's not easy,
a sucker comes along you know?

00:04:52.808 --> 00:04:53.766
- [Mark] Yeah.

00:04:53.766 --> 00:04:56.416
- Got to do what I got to do (laughs).

00:04:56.416 --> 00:04:57.249
- [Mark] If I pay you extra

00:04:57.249 --> 00:04:58.602
can I have you take your sunglasses off?

00:04:58.602 --> 00:04:59.435
(Ahli laughs)

00:04:59.435 --> 00:05:00.435
- All right.

00:05:01.508 --> 00:05:03.160
You gonna make me show my face?

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:04.843
- [Mark] So when did you
first get into drugs?

00:05:07.256 --> 00:05:08.763
- After I had my son.

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:10.933
I was like 14.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.280
I started smoking primos.

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:14.980
- [Mark] Who introduced you to that?

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:17.020
- My boyfriend at the time.

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:19.270
He introduced me to a whole life of drugs,

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:22.123
how to sell drugs, cut drugs,
bang it up, everything.

00:05:26.581 --> 00:05:28.000
Yeah I did that for a long time.

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:30.600
I feel like I've been doing
drugs for like 40 years,

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:33.320
cause that's how it feels

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:36.740
but I don't think it's been
that long, maybe 20 (laughs)

00:05:36.740 --> 00:05:38.100
maybe 20.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:40.090
- [Mark] Do you have any friends?

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:41.918
- I have constituents.

00:05:41.918 --> 00:05:42.808
- [Mark] Acquaintances?

00:05:42.808 --> 00:05:43.641
- Acquaintances.

00:05:43.641 --> 00:05:44.474
- [Mark] Yeah?

00:05:44.474 --> 00:05:45.307
- Yeah.

00:05:45.307 --> 00:05:46.760
Out here I don't know what friends are.

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:47.700
- [Mark] You trust anyone?

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:48.665
- No.

00:05:48.665 --> 00:05:49.580
(both laughing)

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:50.413
- [Mark] You're smart.

00:05:50.413 --> 00:05:51.690
- I don't.

00:05:51.690 --> 00:05:52.530
Sometimes I don't got a choice,

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:53.980
like right now that I left my dog,

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:55.730
I left it with the neighbor,
"Hey watch my dog."

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:57.120
I gotta trust that right now,

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.800
taking a chance you know.

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:00.661
But I need that, I need the help.

00:06:00.661 --> 00:06:01.494
- [Mark] You could be
getting robbed right now

00:06:01.494 --> 00:06:02.740
while you're talking to me.

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:04.956
- I hope not because I
will go postal right now.

00:06:04.956 --> 00:06:05.789
- [Mark] That's how it works right here.

00:06:05.789 --> 00:06:07.543
- I'm the quiet one in the block,

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:11.550
I'm the quiet one, the one
that don't mess with nobody

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:13.190
just leave me alone.

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:15.110
But if you mess with my dog,

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:17.210
I don't guarantee you'll survive (laughs).

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:19.913
- [Mark] What stresses you out?

00:06:19.913 --> 00:06:20.746
What you worried about?

00:06:20.746 --> 00:06:22.710
- I stress about my peace of mind

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:26.003
like I don't like people
messing with me you know?

00:06:26.003 --> 00:06:29.690
Talking (indistinct) like
they don't tell me directly

00:06:29.690 --> 00:06:31.160
they just say it.

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:33.130
Like if they're passing by at my tent,

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:34.500
they'll just something, just say my name.

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:36.820
Like I wanna change my name so bad.

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:37.870
Can I just change my name

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:40.584
cause I hear my name I know
they was talking about me

00:06:40.584 --> 00:06:42.460
like what the fuck?

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:43.850
Cause they're curious
I guess I don't know,

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:44.860
what the fuck?

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:46.453
I say my name must taste good.

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:51.500
- [Mark] With all the stuff
you've gone through in your life

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:53.970
what emotions do you deal with now?

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:54.870
- Anger.

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:55.703
- [Mark] Anger?

00:06:55.703 --> 00:06:56.536
- Yeah.

00:06:56.536 --> 00:06:57.794
- [Mark] It would make sense.

00:06:57.794 --> 00:07:00.143
- A little anger but I don't project it.

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:04.253
I'm hoping I don't but a
lot of people don't like me.

00:07:05.798 --> 00:07:08.248
Maybe I do project anger
or attitude I don't know

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:12.970
but they say, "Ahli, she's
nice. She's nice you know.

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:13.807
She's nice."

00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:18.933
I'd rather be nice, I'd rather be nice.

00:07:20.238 --> 00:07:22.267
- [Mark] What the most
important lesson you've learnt

00:07:22.267 --> 00:07:23.350
in your life?

00:07:25.518 --> 00:07:27.367
- I've learnt a lot of lessons,

00:07:27.367 --> 00:07:28.383
but most important?

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:30.633
Respect goes a long way.

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:36.120
Yeah, respect

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:38.713
yourself.

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:41.043
- [Mark] When you were younger,

00:07:41.043 --> 00:07:43.073
did you have dreams of doing
something with your life?

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:45.530
- How old do you think I am?

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:49.900
- [Mark] 43.

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:51.364
- I'm gonna be 43 this month.

00:07:51.364 --> 00:07:52.360
- [Mark] Good guess.

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:53.380
- Yeah.

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:55.580
I don't know what I wanna do.

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:57.450
I just know that I wanna
get out of the street

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:59.700
and get a job and get myself together.

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.810
I wanna actually get a mobile home

00:08:03.941 --> 00:08:08.941
and do like a store / bike
shop mobile I don't know,

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.560
or maybe catering I don't know something.

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:11.393
- [Mark] It'd be great.

00:08:11.393 --> 00:08:12.462
- Yeah.

00:08:12.462 --> 00:08:14.593
I don't know I sing too, I used to sing.

00:08:16.957 --> 00:08:19.170
But right now, it's hard right now.

00:08:19.170 --> 00:08:20.003
After the holidays

00:08:20.003 --> 00:08:22.577
it's like the depression's
barely leaving you.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:25.840
- [Mark] The holidays make it tough.

00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:26.673
- Yeah.

00:08:26.673 --> 00:08:27.740
- [Mark] Do you feel like
what you went through

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:30.640
with your father and
maybe your lack of support

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:31.473
from your mom

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:36.262
kinda just set the path that you're on?

00:08:36.262 --> 00:08:38.443
- Yeah.

00:08:38.443 --> 00:08:39.276
I think so.

00:08:39.276 --> 00:08:40.693
I'm sure of that.

00:08:41.961 --> 00:08:43.343
- [Mark] It's got to
affect you in some way.

00:08:43.343 --> 00:08:44.310
- It does.

00:08:44.310 --> 00:08:47.980
It does but out here I
learned to hide my emotions

00:08:47.980 --> 00:08:49.630
cause when I first got out here,

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:51.880
oh my God I wore my heart
on my sleeve you know?

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:53.940
And people take advantage of that

00:08:53.940 --> 00:08:56.350
so I just like learnt to not.

00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:57.880
- [Mark] Do you feel
betrayed by your family?

00:08:57.880 --> 00:08:58.713
- Yeah.

00:09:00.380 --> 00:09:01.910
Ultimate, ultimate betrayal.

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:03.020
Can't trust nobody.

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:05.370
If you can't trust your
parents who can you trust?

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:06.730
- [Mark] Right.

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:09.900
- I trust my dog, that's
the only one I trust.

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:12.350
He trusts me so I don't break trust.

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:13.860
If you trust me with your shit

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:15.780
means your shits gonna be all right.

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:18.370
Actually I was doing that as a job,

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:21.583
sometimes with people,
"Watch my shit, what my dog,

00:09:22.650 --> 00:09:24.350
watch my tent" and they'll pay me.

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:28.531
Got to hustle some how but yeah.

00:09:28.531 --> 00:09:29.681
- [Mark] You still have hope?

00:09:29.681 --> 00:09:30.514
- Yeah.

00:09:30.514 --> 00:09:31.720
- [Mark] That life will be fair to you?

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:34.883
- I still have hope yeah.

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:38.353
Yeah I do I'm a Pisces.

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:42.540
So I feel everything

00:09:44.827 --> 00:09:46.450
but I learned to cope with it

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:49.374
by using crystal meth for now.

00:09:49.374 --> 00:09:50.720
- [Mark] What does
crystal meth do for you?

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:53.080
- [Ahli] It helps me cope with shit.

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:55.170
It kind of numbs me a little.

00:09:55.170 --> 00:09:58.210
Helps me to get up and do something.

00:09:58.210 --> 00:10:00.560
- [Mark] Is crystal meth
as addictive as crack?

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:04.170
- [Ahli] I think crack is more addictive

00:10:06.651 --> 00:10:08.440
but it's a different high.

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:10.500
Crystal meth is more mental

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:14.830
and it's like a mood
enhancer and it last longer

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:15.680
and it's cheaper.

00:10:22.667 --> 00:10:24.570
Due to all that that I went through

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:26.363
I became like real introvert.

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:30.100
I'm always inside me, I look at me first

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:32.730
cause I was wondering like what
the fuck did I do you know?

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:33.563
- [Mark] Yeah.

00:10:33.563 --> 00:10:34.396
- What did I do?

00:10:36.379 --> 00:10:37.750
But that makes me do with everything,

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:41.450
every situation that I go
through I reflect on myself first

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:44.250
cause maybe it's something
I'm doing wrong I don't know.

00:10:45.401 --> 00:10:46.251
But I try my best

00:10:48.461 --> 00:10:49.960
to not fuck with people.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:50.880
- [Mark] I think it's a balance

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:54.139
between taking responsibility
for everything in your life.

00:10:54.139 --> 00:10:54.972
- [Ahli] Exactly.

00:10:54.972 --> 00:10:56.180
- [Mark] As well as seeing clearly

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:57.810
that what your father did to you

00:10:57.810 --> 00:11:00.897
and what your family
maybe allowed to happen

00:11:00.897 --> 00:11:02.780
is kind of out of your control.

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:05.725
- Yeah. I mean I had to go
to therapy and shit you know

00:11:05.725 --> 00:11:06.670
but that helped me.

00:11:06.670 --> 00:11:07.503
- [Mark] Was therapy helpful?

00:11:07.503 --> 00:11:08.336
- Yeah.

00:11:08.336 --> 00:11:10.523
Imma start therapy again.

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:17.073
I'm taking depression pills so yeah.

00:11:19.683 --> 00:11:21.263
But my worker she sucks.

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:25.393
But I'm coping with shit.

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:28.900
I feel like you know,

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:30.290
I don't really make a big deal about it

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:32.180
