00:13:37.587 --> 00:13:38.600
- For a year.

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:39.496
- [Mark] For a year?

00:13:39.496 --> 00:13:40.700
- Yeah.

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:42.370
I was all die hard Christian

00:13:42.370 --> 00:13:43.820
and I was in the worship team

00:13:47.030 --> 00:13:47.930
and then I woke up

00:13:49.813 --> 00:13:52.900
