stone to my spiritual life.

00:13:56.470 --> 00:13:59.100
I'm like spiritual trying to be human

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:02.080
so it's kind of weird.

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:02.920
- [Mark] I think we all are.

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:04.930
- Yeah but we don't know.

00:14:07.971 --> 00:14:09.880
